{
    "UniqueID": "Tgr_HW_AlgaeBloom",
    "//AlgaeBloom": "The algae bloom's roll (plan section 13 as built; Documentation/Research/HarshWilds/wave0-threats.md section 5, the W0-8 finding), the drought's pattern (Tgr_HW_Drought.json): a rolled SelfTriggeredAction arms a self-timed hidden effect stat (hw_stat_algaebloom), and there is NO CT3 event card and no art. A bloom needs a hot, dry summer, so the dry gate is taken from the drought's own measured stats (Documentation/Design/Harsh_Wilds_As_Built.md 6.1), and there are TWO ACTIONS, because an STA gate is one range on one counter and the dry counter is held at 0 while a drought runs: action 0 rolls after a dry spell, action 1 rolls during a drought. The two can never both be eligible: while a drought runs Tgr_HW_DrySpellHold holds hw_stat_dryspell at 0, below action 0's gate, and with no drought running action 1's drought gate is shut. ALL GATES ARE StatChangeTrigger ENTRIES, never RequiredStatValues: an unresolved trigger stat never fires (fails closed) while an unresolved RequiredStatValues stat is skipped (fails open). Action 0, five gates: hw_switch_algaebloom {1,1} (with the [Threats] AlgaeBloom switch off this can never fire); vanilla SeasonCounter_Summer (4a9284146ffc28242b1f591ac7f7541f) {1,2880}, summer only; hw_stat_dryspell {HW_ALGAE_DRYSPELL_TICKS = 288, 1344}, at least three days without rain (the drought itself needs four); vanilla RainValue (773fb34e869224f499d43b441c973c62) {0,0}, not raining at the roll, which matters only with the [Threats] Drought switch off, because hw_stat_dryspell's reset then never runs and the counter sits at its cap (with Drought on, any rain resets the counter below 288, so this gate adds nothing); hw_stat_algaebloom {0,0}, no bloom already running. Action 1, four gates: the switch; summer; hw_stat_drought {1,672}, a drought is running (the timer's whole running range); no bloom running. Both: RepeatOptions 0 (Repeat), ActionCooldown 96 and OncePerTick, one roll a game day while every gate holds; a Nothing pick counts as a firing, so it also starts the cooldown. Roll: Nothing (weight HW_ALGAE_NOTHING_WEIGHT = 5, one card-less drop) against Algae Bloom (weight HW_ALGAE_EVENT_WEIGHT = 1, one card-less drop too, since a collection with no potential drop gets weight 0 and could never be picked), so a 1 in 6 chance on each eligible day. The Algae Bloom collection's own StatModifications (applied only when that collection is picked) arm hw_stat_algaebloom by HW_ALGAE_TICKS = 288, its max; the stat's status does the rest and ends it at 0. THIS STA NEVER WRITES a fish population stat: an STA's StatModifications are Permanent base writes that nothing takes back. Every number here is a TUNABLE PLACEHOLDER, session-inferred and unmeasured against play, never balanced. UNMEASURED: how often a real summer reaches a three day dry spell (the drought's open check C3).",
